          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 665,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.080:block:1",
          "start": 293
        },
        "quote": "(b) The Planning Director shall establish such administrative rules and regulations as necessary to govern the procedure, submission requirements, and contents necessary to determine compliance with the design standards of an NCD. The Planning Director, or designee, shall review the design plans to determine compliance with the design standards adopted for the district.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.080:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.270.080 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "0a34bc69-d6f6-5d41-9798-170c031d5be3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1008,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.080:block:2",
          "start": 666
        },
        "quote": "(c) If the Planning Director determines that the work and/or design plans are in conformance with the design standards adopted for the district, the Planning Director shall issue a zoning compliance permit and the Department of Development Services may issue a building permit, consistent with all other requisite ordinances and requirements.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.080:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.270.080 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "67d53106-95a5-52c5-a129-d22f32688b38",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1271,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.080:block:3",
          "start": 1009
        },
        "quote": "(d) If the Planning Director determines that the design plans are not in conformance with the design standards adopted for the district, the Planning Department shall not approve the plans, and, furthermore, shall identify the specific design standards violated.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.080:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
